# MenuMaker — shape of the environment. COPY to .env, fill in real values, never commit.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the CLIENT BUNDLE at build time.
# Anything here is therefore PUBLIC — readable by anyone who opens the site and reads
# the JavaScript. Only put values here that are safe to publish.

# ── Supabase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Safe to publish: the anon key is public by design and is governed by RLS.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<supabase anon key>

# ── Anthropic (kitchen stock / purchaser photo analysis) ──────────────────────
# ⚠️ NOT SAFE AS A VITE_ VARIABLE. A VITE_-prefixed API key is compiled into the
# bundle and shipped to every browser — anyone can read it and spend against it.
# Verified 2026-07-30: the built bundle contains the literal key.
#
# The correct home for this key is a server-side Supabase edge function that the
# browser calls; the key then never leaves the server. Until that function exists,
# leaving this variable set means the key is public.
#
# Consumers today: src/pages/PurchaserApp.tsx, src/pages/kitchen-stock/KitchenStockPage.tsx
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<do not put a live key here — see note above>
VITE_ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
